---
name: background_audio_control
alias: 乐章执掌
brief: "Background audio: play, pause, volume, generate audio/SFX"
description: "背景音频控制：播放、暂停、音量调节，以及通过文字描述生成音频/音效"
keywords:
  - 音乐
  - 音频
  - 音效
  - 播放
  - 音量
  - bgm
  - audio
  - music
  - sfx
when_to_use: "When user wants to control background audio, generate music/SFX, or adjust volume"
parameters:
  - name: action
    type: string
    description: "play/pause/stop/volume_up/volume_down/set_volume/generate/generate_sfx/help"
    required: true
  - name: volume
    type: number
    description: "音量 0-100"
    required: false
  - name: audio_id
    type: string
    description: "音频 ID"
    required: false
  - name: prompt
    type: string
    description: "生成音频的文本描述"
    required: false
executor: builtin:background_audio_control
---
